abstract: >-
  Interactive browser-based 3D simulation of Earth's magnetosphere: solar storms
  (flare, solar energetic particles, CME), cosmic-ray trajectories in the
  geomagnetic field, Van Allen belts, aurora, satellites and space-weather
  indices (Kp, Dst, NOAA G/S/R), with a Turkish/English educational interface.
keywords:
  - magnetosphere
  - space weather
  - solar storm
  - cosmic rays
